Now before we,

00:31:04.380 --> 00:31:08.353
before this takes a trip to the dark side,

00:31:09.239 --> 00:31:11.410
I'm gonna talk about
a lot of the positives

00:31:11.410 --> 00:31:13.510
because I think that this has
