And we put on some music, change
the lighting a little bit.

00:31:40.600 --> 00:31:41.810
Still in the kitchen, I'm not talking

00:31:41.810 --> 00:31:43.119
about the bedroom yet.

00:31:43.119 --> 00:31:43.952
Okay,

00:31:43.952 --> 00:31:46.056
that's where it begins.
Where the sorting of mail

00:31:46.056 --> 00:31:46.889
is happening,

00:31:46.889 --> 00:31:50.700
and we just have a nice dinner and we talk

00:31:50.700 --> 00:31:52.750
about the nature of our relationship,

00:31:52.750 --> 00:31:54.429
we actually talk about how we talk.

00:31:54.429 --> 00:31:56.643
I think that's been good.

00:31:57.640 --> 00:31:59.690
We got our family movie night that we do

00:31:59.690 --> 00:32:02.180
every Friday night where
we all sit down and try

00:32:02.180 --> 00:32:04.520
to agree on a movie, which
has been going pretty well.

