Really?

00:32:05.353 --> 00:32:07.010
Watched Tombstone the other night,

00:32:07.010 --> 00:32:08.785
that was a hit.
Mm hmm.

00:32:08.785 --> 00:32:11.094
Val Kilmer's performance,
Not on your list, but...

00:32:11.094 --> 00:32:13.470
One of the best ever.

00:32:13.470 --> 00:32:16.440
Kurt Russell, a little
uneven acting in that movie,

00:32:16.440 --> 00:32:17.583
but he's Kurt Russell.

