there's a lot of family
interaction that's happening

00:32:43.310 --> 00:32:47.870
at a higher volume that has been great,

00:32:47.870 --> 00:32:50.690
but of course, with all that interaction

00:32:51.730 --> 00:32:53.870
with the good comes the bad.

00:32:53.870 --> 00:32:55.520
Yeah, we've had...

00:32:55.520 --> 00:32:58.783
I mean, you know how the Neal's are,

00:32:58.783 --> 00:33:00.860
they like to stay hydrated

00:33:00.860 --> 00:33:02.320
and when we go in on something,

00:33:02.320 --> 00:33:05.410
